# Parameter definitions for thorn TestReal4
#
# The analytic test functions and their tolerances are fixed in the source
# code so that each test is fully self-contained; only which of the tests
# in this thorn are active is steered via the parameters below.
#
# TestReal4 is a single thorn shared by four independent parfiles
# (par/testreal4.par, par/testreal4_2lev.par, par/testreal4_bc.par,
# par/testreal4_evol.par), each exercising a different Phase of CarpetX's
# mixed-precision support with a different grid/boundary/level setup. Since
# a thorn's schedule.ccl is unconditional, every parfile that activates
# TestReal4 would otherwise run *all* of these self-checks together, even
# though (e.g.) the original single-level periodic self-test assumes
# periodic boundaries and a single refinement level, which the other
# parfiles' setups do not provide. These booleans, combined with `SCHEDULE
# ... IF` clauses in schedule.ccl, let each parfile enable only the test(s)
# it is set up for.

BOOLEAN run_periodic_test "Run the original single-level periodic ghost-sync self-test (state8/state4, TestReal4_Initialize/_Check/_CheckGF3D5)"
{
} "yes"

BOOLEAN run_2lev_test "Run the two-level regrid+prolongation self-test (state8_2lev/state4_2lev)"
{
} "no"

BOOLEAN run_bc_test "Run the physical (dirichlet) boundary condition self-test (state8_bc/state4_bc)"
{
} "no"

BOOLEAN run_evol_test "Run the ODESolvers evolution smoke test (state8_evol/state4_evol)"
{
} "no"

CCTK_REAL evol_decay_rate "Decay rate lambda in du/dt = -lambda u for the evolution smoke test"
{
  (0:* :: "any positive rate"
} 1.0

CCTK_REAL evol_u0 "Initial value u(t=0) for the evolution smoke test"
{
  *:* :: "any value"
} 1.0
